    "story": {
      "type": "ea-about-story",
      "settings": {
        "title": "Our *story.*",
        "thanks": ""
      },
      "blocks": {
        "story_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-founders-yvelin-anu-light.jpg",
            "heading": "A short note from us",
            "text": "<p>For more than ten years, we helped other companies develop and source products, and sell them online. But life is full of surprises, and in 2025 we started our own brand, to bring high-quality gifts to the market. We know how hard it is to find a gift for someone who already has everything, and how hard it is to bring a high-quality product to life. So, naturally, we picked golf: a game we play badly, for people who already own everything. With such enthusiasm, what could go wrong?</p>",
            "signature": "Anu & Yvelin"
          }
        },
        "story_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-eagle-on-ash-landing.jpg",
            "heading": "Why Eagle & Ash",
            "text": "<p>An eagle is two under par on one hole: rare, and worth remembering. Ash is a symbol of strength: in old Norse stories, the tree that holds up the world is an ash. Its pale wood has a beautiful grain, and it is not easy to craft. We chose it because it is strong, different and beautiful, and it grows along the fairways of many old golf courses. And we found makers with the talent to bring it to life.</p>"
          }
        },
        "story_3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-ball-display-on-shelf.jpg",
            "heading": "A drawer full of golf balls",
            "text": "<p>Ask a golfer where the ball from their best round is. Often the answer is: in a drawer, with all the others. That ball deserves better. So one of our first gifts was a display of ash wood and stone that holds one ball and lets you spin it. A simple idea. Our first choice was lava stone: born from fire. Manufacturing corrected us, and we tested dozens of stone and composite materials before we found one that works in real production. The rest followed just as naturally: leather tee pouches, bamboo tees with height markers, and bath bombs that look like golf balls. And finally, we had a gift series of our own (and now a website!), for the golfer who already has everything.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "story_1",
        "story_2",
        "story_3"
      ]
    },
