            "answer": "<p>Anu and Yvelin, two founders in Estonia. For more than ten years we developed and sourced products for other companies; in 2025 we started our own brand. Our company, VERTOHOUSE OÜ, is registered in Tallinn, Estonia.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you play golf?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, badly. Our golf swings are not checked by anyone, and it shows.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where are your products made?",
            "answer": "<p>Every gift is designed in Estonia. The ball display trophy is made in Tartu, Estonia, the leather tee pouches in Istanbul, Turkey, the golf ball bath bombs in Riga, Latvia, and the bamboo tees in China. Our gift boxes are designed by a packaging designer in the US.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Have you been to the workshops?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. We visit our workshops, and we stay in close contact with them through the whole production process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you engrave?",
            "answer": "<p>Not ourselves. The hole-in-one ball display has a blank circle on its underside, so any local engraver can add a name or a date.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I order on this website?",
            "answer": "<p>No. This website shows our gifts, and you buy them on Amazon.com. Our stock is in Amazon's US warehouses, so Amazon ships your order with Prime delivery and handles any return. Companies and golf clubs can order 10 or more through Bulk orders.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I know it's really you on Amazon?",
            "answer": "<p>Every “Shop on Amazon” button on this website opens our own product page on Amazon, where the brand link under the title leads to the Eagle &amp; Ash store.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you sell in bulk?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, to companies, golf clubs and events, from 10 pieces. In the US, bulk orders ship through Amazon; in the EU, from Tallinn. The bath bombs are available in the US only. Send the form on <a href=\"/pages/wholesale\">Bulk orders</a>; we reply within one business day.</p>"
          }
        }
